<title>USA: Sioux City cattle $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade moderately active. Compared to last Monday slaughter steers and heifers 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter  Steers: Choice 2-3 drug free 1230 lbs  65.00.</p>
<p>Choice  2-3 1125-1425 lbs 62.50-63.25, One load 1615 lbs 62.50.</p>
<p>Select and  Choice 1150-1350 lbs 62.00-62.35. Select 61.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter  Heifers: Choice 2-3 drug free 1233 lbs 65.00.</p>
<p>Choice  2-3 1150-1200 lbs 62.25-62.85. Select and Choice 1050-1300 lbs 61.00-62.25. Select 58.00-60.00.</p>
</text>
